PREFIX='''Use case: stylized-concept. Asset: genuine transparent 2D fighting game sprite animation board. Reference image ONLY fixes Clorinde identity, clothing, anatomy and cel shading; DRAW NEW POSES, never copy its pose layout. Clorinde from Genshin Impact: adult natural anime anatomy, NOT chibi, indigo long hair, navy tricorne with complete white feather, navy fitted duelist coat, violet-blue long cape with gold trim, white shirt/cuffs and gloves, purple tights, navy low-heel boots with folded white cuffs. Right hand is main sword/gun hand; pistol and visible sword sheath at waist. Exactly two arms, two hands and two legs; no duplicate weapons. Same camera, side three-quarter toward RIGHT throughout; same anatomical scale and head/torso/leg lengths across poses. Entire feather/cape/weapon/boots with wide clear alpha gaps and generous outside margins. Clean broad cel colors and fine coordinated blue-black contour. NO background fog, lighting, floor, shadow, text, panels, grid lines or labels. NO effects, lightning, bullets or slash trails on body layer. Weapon grip must be physically connected, slender sword has same actual length, pistol shape remains stable. Do not make canvas/hat/weapon determine body scale.'''

def prompt(key):
    label,n,ticks,poses,root=SPECS[key]
    return PREFIX+'\nCRITICAL body-build lock: use the supplied single-character master as the same tall slender woman in every action. Preserve its narrow waist/pelvis, slender thighs/calves/arms, torso length and actual leg segments. Never redraw stockier or shorter figures to fit a pose board. Bent knees/lunges change pose height, not actual build. No whole-bitmap width/height distortion or arbitrary head-body-ratio redesign.'+f'\nDraw {n} distinct full-body poses, ordered left to right then top to bottom, '+('two rows of three' if n==6 else 'two rows of two')+'. No equal cell boundary requirement; space objects far enough that no bodies/weapons overlap. '+f'Action: {label}.\n'+'\n'.join(f'Pose {i+1}: {p}.' for i,p in enumerate(poses))+f'\nMovement meaning: {root}. Do not replace action with unarmed punches or kicks. Show preparation, effective movement and recovery clearly.'
